/T (Data for this study came from Visual Crossing, which gives daily details from 2013 to 2024. It covers temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed, wind gust, moon phase, sea level pressure, cloud cover, visibility, solar radiation, and solar energy. Flood information was collected from articles and publications focusing on recorded flood events in Lagos from 2021 to 2024.)
/E (Data for this study came from Visual Crossing, which gives daily details from 2013 to 2024. It covers temperature, humidity, rainfall, wind speed, wind gust, moon phase, sea level pressure, cloud cover, visibility, solar radiation, and solar energy. Flood information was collected from articles and publications focusing on recorded flood events in Lagos from 2021 to 2024.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
